{"_id":"mh1WvkpiPRYjHvu8","name":"Senidaemon","type":"npc","img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-pf2e/art/senidaemon.webp","items":[{"_id":"ZCkgwuRoS9We32Dx","name":"Aura of Unmaking","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":100000,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Template[type:emanation|distance:30]{30 feet} @Compendium[pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.v61oEQaDdcRpaZ9X]{Aura}</p>\n<p>The senidaemon radiates entropic energy, threatening the physical and spiritual integrity of living things around it.</p>\n<p>The senidaemon can manifest this ability in one of two ways: unraveling or heat shimmer. Any creature that enters or begins its turn in the aura is affected.</p>\n<p>If the senidaemon is emitting an unraveling aura, creatures take [[/r (2d6+6)[void]]] damage (@Check[type:fortitude|dc:24|name:Unraveling DC|traits:damaging-effect, aura, divine, necromancy, negative|showDC:gm]{basic Fortitude} save); if it is emitting a heat shimmer, each creature must attempt a @Check[type:fortitude|dc:24|name:Heat Shimmer DC|traits:aura, divine, necromancy, negative|showDC:gm]{Fortitude} save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.TkIyaNPgTZFBCCuh]{Dazzled}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is dazzled and @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Fatigued]{Fatigued}.</p>\n\n<p>The senidaemon can change its aura from unraveling to heat shimmer and vice versa, or cease or activate its aura, by spending a single action, which has the concentrate trait.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["aura","divine"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"D9P6Vw16xpCKvB7c","name":"Malignant Entropy","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Reaction.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":600000,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The senidaemon takes acid, cold, physical, or positive damage;</p>\n\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The senidaemon glows faintly as it converts the damage it just took into raw power. Until the end of its next turn, the senidaemon's Strikes deal additional damage equal to the number of dice rolled in the triggering attack.</p>\n<p>@Compendium[battlezoo-bestiary-pf2e.pf2e-battlezoo-bestiary-effects.LQP8xZuOrfaTVy5n]{Effect: Malignant Entropy (1 Dice)}</p>\n<p>@Compendium[battlezoo-bestiary-pf2e.pf2e-battlezoo-bestiary-effects.ElT1YX5FxoRysyyH]{Effect: Malignant Entropy (2 Dice)}</p>\n<p>@Compendium[battlezoo-bestiary-pf2e.pf2e-battlezoo-bestiary-effects.YHRflyOzYbZM6GAp]{Effect: Malignant Entropy (3 Dice)}</p>\n<p>@Compendium[battlezoo-bestiary-pf2e.pf2e-battlezoo-bestiary-effects.4WVY2VdZ3VEjNdpe]{Effect: Malignant Entropy (4 Dice)}</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["divine"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"iY6PhkiweaOzD4kB","name":"Silent Casting","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":250000,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The senidaemon can substitute somatic components for verbal components of any spell it casts.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"YxUZCHNAcKv4cgqL","name":"Soul Erosion","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":200000,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The senidaemon's presence intensifies spiritual destruction. Any living creature brought to 0 HP within the senidaemon's aura of unmaking must attempt a @Check[type:will|dc:24|name:Soul Erosion Will DC|traits:curse, divine, necromancy|showDC:gm]{Will} save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The next time the creature dies, the caster of a spell to return it to life must succeed at a @Check[type:religion|dc:25|name:Soul Erosion Religion DC|traits:curse, divine, necromancy|showDC:gm]{Religion} check. On a success, the curse is lifted and the creature is returned to life as normal for the spell. On a failure, the spell is wasted and the creature remains dead.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, and the creature becomes @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.3uh1r86TzbQvosxv]{Doomed 1}.</p>\n"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["curse","divine"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"5J0JDmPpYuZQfL6X","name":"Molten Hand","type":"melee","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"value":"","gm":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["finesse","magical","unholy"],"otherTags":[]},"damageRolls":{"c0Z28vFIsLqvIAKC":{"damage":"2d6+4","damageType":"bludgeoning"},"4EGbeXqlTZySYR4D":{"damage":"2d6","damageType":"spirit"}},"bonus":{"value":18},"attackEffects":{"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"6.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":1721533117790,"lastModifiedBy":"l2rbNx2a8f5ocpeL","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"0iIBnxFm0RpLUHNz","name":"Darkvision","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":450000,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","va